# Optional. Only needed locally to refresh the pinned-projects list and
# contribution totals via GitHub's GraphQL API (scripts/fetch-github-data.mjs).
# Without it, the script still works: it falls back to a hardcoded pinned
# list and reads totals from the public contributions page instead.
#
# Locally you can also just run: GH_TOKEN=$(gh auth token) npm run fetch-data
GH_TOKEN=
